CLASS com/xk72/lib/class_1567 com/xk72/lib/ImageLoadObserver
	COMMENT One-shot ImageObserver used as a completion latch: imageUpdate keeps
	COMMENT returning true until ALLBITS|ERROR|ABORT (0x20|0x40|0x80) arrives, then sets
	COMMENT the flag, notifies waiters and returns false. Sole caller is the image
	COMMENT Transferable in com/charlesproxy/gui/transaction/actions (class_569), which
	COMMENT does prepareImage(img, -1, -1, this) and then
	COMMENT synchronized (o) { while (!o.isDone()) o.wait(10000); }.
